+Signed-off-by: Zhiyu722 <Zhiyu722@users.noreply.github.com>
+---
+ EEBBK_S6_changes.md                  | 394 +++++++++++++++++++--------
+ s6patch声音/README.md              | 292 ++++++++++++++++++++
+ s6patch声音/build_eebbk_clang11.sh |  95 +++++++
